    "description": "Transfer the target-layer temperature from the same KST calendar timestamp one year earlier, then add the depth-interpolated contemporaneous public-layer temperature anomaly between layers 1 and 5.",
    "structurally_distinct_from": [
      "tree or neural residual fitting",
